-- Semantic recall via `lean_leansearch`: `Topology.CWComplex` with the finiteness class
-- `Topology.CWComplex.Finite` is the canonical owner for source examples asserting the existence
-- of low-dimensional CW decompositions, while Chapter 3 already owns the real projective plane as
